OL,3,GNEWSARailway station entrance scheme
OL,4,Adelayed further
OL,5,
OL,6,FA much-delayed scheme to transform the
OL,7,Fentrance to Leeds station will begin
OL,8,Fopening next month, the city's council
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FThe Leeds Station Sustainable Travel
OL,12,FGateway was initially due to be
OL,13,Fcompleted in autumn 2025, before being
OL,14,Fpushed back to summer 2026 and then
OL,15,Fagain to September.
OL,17,FThe #46.1m project will create more
OL,18,Fpedestrian-friendly streets, a new taxi
OL,19,Frank and better facilities for storing
OL,20,Fbikes.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
